{
  "bridge_text": "The secret of their future hangs in the air like the dimming light of the firefly, but we must see what Lina chooses to do. Back in the quiet hollow, the moss feels cool beneath her hands.",
  "resume_strategy": "continue",
  "replacement_segments": [
